# CLIENT SITE REPLICAS — pages in demo/ that are NOT spec mockups.
#
# A slug here holds a full replica of a SIGNED CLIENT's site, not a generated
# prospect mockup. The MOCKUP-BASELINE rules (style-pack comment, print CSS,
# generated-asset gallery, unc-added provenance meta) describe the mockup
# generator's output and do not apply to hand-built client work.
#
# Before this file existed, gate.sh failed New View on every single run with
# "no-print-css no-pack-comment no-form" and added_dates warned about its
# missing unc-added meta — noise that every run had to be told to ignore, which
# is exactly how a real failure gets missed.
#
# DO NOT "fix" a page listed here to satisfy the gate. Exclude it instead.
#
# Read by gate.sh, tools/enrich_audit.py and tools/added_dates.py.

